<title>KUWAIT: Missing, one Kuwaiti observation balloon.</title>
<headline>Missing, one Kuwaiti observation balloon.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait is searching for an early warning blimp designed to watch for Iraqi troop movements that blew away earlier this month, diplomats said on Saturday.</p>
<p>They said the helium-filled balloon, fitted with radar, flew off as ground staff were pulling it back to the ground in strong winds. It was launched last June to monitor the tiny Gulf Arab state's borders.</p>
